# SemVer Release Policy

Canonical execution: `.cursor/skills/semver-release/SKILL.md`.
Reminder when a tag is likely needed: `.cursor/rules/share/gitflow-branch-policy.mdc`.
Human how-to: `docs/development/GIT_TAGS_AND_RELEASES.md`.

## Do

- Create product tags only via Actions workflow `Release` (`workflow_dispatch`).
- Use SemVer (`0.1.0` or `0.1.0-test.1`). GitHub tag is `v` + that number.
- Confirm the version with the owner before dispatch.
- Prefer a prerelease (`-test.N`) until they explicitly want a production number.

## Do not

- `git tag` / `git push --tags` on `feature/*` as the ship path.
- Tag every merge to `develop`.
- `--force` existing tags.
- Deploy to Chabokan as part of tagging (that is a later CD step).
